            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Improved
- **The menu bar panel is smoother while it's open.** With several agents
  running, it redrew dozens of times a second; it now redraws about once a
  second, and only when something you can see changes.
- Running timers can read up to a second longer than before.
]]></description>
